    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[10].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Your the chosen one that can be my high score dude!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[11].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: "no no no.. I\u2019m just an average dude plus I don\u2019t have time
        to deal with whatever this is..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[12].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: NO NO NO please, PLEASE! You must beat my high score.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[13].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Why would I do that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[14].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: So I can get better and defeat Boogy Bob..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[15].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Boogy who?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[16].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Boogy Bob!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[17].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[18].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Boogy Bob the ultimate disco king.. His dance dance high score was insane
        much better then mine...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[19].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: "Ok I don\u2019t really care.. Plus this has gone on way longer then
        any other dialogue sequence I\u2019ve been apart of..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[20].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: "Ok Ok... If you beat my high score in dance dance then I\u2019ll gift
        you a cool new outfit... How about it buddy..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[21].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: WAIT... DID YOU SAY, OUTFIT!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[22].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: "Say no more I\u2019m so down to break that stupid record. Where do
        I beat it?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[23].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: WHOOOOO! Now thats the spirit
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[24].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: The dance dance game is just through the doors behind me in the disco
        club. Beat the score.. Get the outfit easy as pie.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[25].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: BET! New side quest here I come!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
