      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[13].dialogueEntries.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[0].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: ALL OF YOU STAY BACK
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[1].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Who are you talking to kid and why are you in the bin?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[2].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: YOU AND YOUR GANG!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[3].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Its only me here, your definitely friends with the wheelchair kid
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[4].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: YOU KNOW Kwabena Olajide?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[5].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Yes, now get out of their cause this has to be the worst side quest
        I've done
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[6].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: I CAN'T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[7].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Why not
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[8].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: I HAVE NO ARMS OR LEGS I'M STUCK
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[9].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Of course you are
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[10].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: I saw a crazy scientist walk by me saying how his inventions sucked
        and I saw that it was a robot. Maybe you can grab the arms and legs from
        that robot and attach them to me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[11].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Worth a shot, I guess. Do you know the general area?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[12].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Erm maybe... I heard him saying something about how annoying it was
        to get on to a roof.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[13].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Great thanks kid
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7867874687787715051, guid: 71ad012ba448cfc4095ba5a04e9672b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[0].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].speakerName
