      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[10].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Yeah, we have concrete evidence that Ms Pusee is running the biggest
        drug ring in the west
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4494070486120546777, guid: e1bc59de2c05988489855cb824ccbad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[11].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: So, the football was the concrete evidence?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4494070486120546777, guid: e1bc59de2c05988489855cb824ccbad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[12].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: No this is just our football, and this poopy head lost it
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4494070486120546777, guid: e1bc59de2c05988489855cb824ccbad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSequences.Array.data[13].dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].line
      value: Now scram civilian while I teach this pee pee head a lesson
